SET content_structure_json = '{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Clause 1 (Definitions and Interpretation). In this Facility Offer Letter and the Finance Documents, capitalised terms have the meanings given in this Clause 1 or in Schedule 1 (Facility Particulars) unless the context otherwise requires. This document follows the structure and drafting conventions of the LMA recommended form for a multicurrency term and revolving facilities agreement (investment grade), as published by the Loan Market Association and commonly used by international wholesale banks."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Clause 1.2 (Construction). Clause, schedule and paragraph headings are for ease of reference only and do not affect interpretation. Unless a contrary indication appears, references to Clauses and Schedules are to clauses and schedules of this letter; references to a \"Finance Document\" include this letter, any Fee Letter, the Utilisation Request, Security Documents and any other document designated as such by the Agent."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.1 \"A\" means c"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"For the avoidance of doubt, references to \"A\" throughout the Finance Documents shall be construed in accordance with market practice under the LMA recommended form, including any supplemental definitions set out in Schedule 1 (Facility Particulars) and the term sheet dated on or about the Signing Date."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.2 \"a\" means  "},{"type":"paragraph","text":"For the avoidance of doubt, references to \"a\" throughout the Finance Documents shall be construed in accordance with market practice under the LMA recommended form, including any supplemental definitions set out in Schedule 1 (Facility Particulars) and the term sheet dated on or about the Signing Date."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.3 \"A\" means c"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"For the avoidance of doubt, references to \"A\" throughout the Finance Documents shall be construed in accordance with market p